A collectible is an item from before 2020 that is consistently high in value and demand whether it is hyped or not. These items vary in categories, such as [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]], [[Rare Weapons|rare]], [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]], [[Common Weapons|common]], and in some circumstances, [[Miscellaneous Items|miscs]]. Due to the fact the vast majority of these items are from 2020 or earlier, they are only obtainable through trading.

